---
interface Props {
  eyebrow?: string;
  title?: string;
  intro?: string;
}

const {
  eyebrow = "Wander bedroom · full-screen entrance",
  title = "欢迎来到会随时间变化的房间。",
  intro = "把鼠标移到书架、书桌、墙上的画或床头灯附近，点一下就能推进去看看那条支线。",
} = Astro.props;
---

<section class="wander-diorama-shell" data-wander-3d data-wander-2d>
  <div class="wander-diorama-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">{eyebrow}</p>
    <h2>{title}</h2>
    <p>{intro}</p>
    <p class="wander-sr-only" id="wander-scene-description">一间会随时间变化光线的卧室：左侧是装满书的书架，右侧是带电脑的书桌，墙上挂着一幅风景画，床头有一盏暖灯。可以使用下方按钮探索四个区域。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wander-diorama-stage" data-diorama-stage aria-describedby="wander-scene-description">
    <div class="wander-diorama-art" data-diorama-art>
      <img class="wander-room-photo" data-wander-room-photo src="/wander/bedroom-dusk.webp" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" />
      <img class="wander-room-photo wander-room-photo-next" data-wander-room-photo-next src="/wander/bedroom-dusk.webp" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" aria-hidden="true" />
      <div class="wander-art-fallback" data-wander-art-fallback hidden>
        <strong>房间画面暂时没有加载出来。</strong>
        <span>你仍然可以从下面的文字入口继续浏览。</span>
      </div>
      <div class="wander-room-vignette" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="wander-dust" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="wander-diorama-hotspots" aria-label="房间热点">
        <button type="button" data-room-camera="anime" class="room-hotspot hotspot-anime" aria-label="书架 · 番剧书架"><span class="room-hotspot-label">书架</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-room-camera="notes" class="room-hotspot hotspot-notes" aria-label="书桌 · 支线随笔"><span class="room-hotspot-label">书桌</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-room-camera="photo" class="room-hotspot hotspot-photo" aria-label="墙上的画 · 照片墙"><span class="room-hotspot-label">照片墙</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-room-camera="memo" class="room-hotspot hotspot-memo" aria-label="床头灯 · 小木电台"><span class="room-hotspot-label">电台</span></button>
        <button type="button" class="wander-easter-egg" data-wander-easter-egg aria-label="发现窗边的小彩蛋">✦</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="wander-3d-hint" data-room-hint>把鼠标移到物件上看看 · 点击开始漫游</div>
    <div class="wander-3d-memory" aria-live="polite"><span data-room-memory></span><span data-room-progress>已探索 0 / 4</span></div>
    <p class="wander-room-finale" data-wander-room-finale hidden>窗外的灯一盏盏亮起来了。这里的每条支线，都已经留下了你的脚印。</p>
    <div class="wander-3d-controls" aria-label="房间入口">
      <button type="button" data-room-camera="center" aria-pressed="true">回到房间</button>
      <button type="button" data-room-camera="anime" aria-pressed="false">番剧书架</button>
      <button type="button" data-room-camera="photo" aria-pressed="false">照片墙</button>
      <button type="button" data-room-camera="notes" aria-pressed="false">支线随笔</button>
      <button type="button" data-room-camera="memo" aria-pressed="false">小木电台</button>
    </div>
    <a href="/wander/" class="wander-3d-enter" data-room-enter>逛一圈 →</a>
    <button type="button" class="wander-3d-skip" data-wander-3d-skip>使用文字目录</button>
  </div>
  <div class="wander-game-panel" data-wander-game-panel hidden aria-live="polite">
    <div class="wander-game-heading"><div><p class="wander-game-kicker">MINIGAME 01 · ANIME SHELF</p><h3>整理书架，找回这一格记忆。</h3></div><button type="button" class="wander-game-close" data-wander-game-close aria-label="关闭小游戏">×</button></div>
    <p class="wander-game-copy">选一本书，再选一个位置。把三本书放回正确顺序，不限时间。</p>
    <div class="wander-book-slots" data-wander-book-slots aria-label="书架位置"></div>
    <div class="wander-book-tray" data-wander-book-tray aria-label="待整理的书"></div>
    <p class="wander-game-status" data-wander-game-status>先选一本书。</p>
    <div class="wander-game-actions"><button type="button" data-wander-game-reset>重新打乱</button><a href="/wander/anime/" data-wander-game-skip>跳过，直接进入书架 →</a></div>
    <div class="wander-game-complete" data-wander-game-complete hidden><strong>书架亮起来了。</strong><span>你找到了一条番剧支线，继续往里面看看。</span><a href="/wander/anime/">进入番剧书架 →</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .wander-diorama-shell { position: relative; margin-top: 1.5rem; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, .25); border-radius: 1.25rem; background: #211a35; color: #fff7ed; box-shadow: 0 1.5rem 4rem rgba(124, 58, 237, .12); }
  .wander-diorama-copy { padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 0; }
  .wander-sr-only { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0; }
  .wander-diorama-copy h2 { margin-top: .5rem; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.8rem; letter-spacing: -.03em; text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #2d1e3e; }
  .wander-diorama-copy p:last-child { max-width: 38rem; margin-top: .65rem; color: #e6d6e6; font-size: .875rem; line-height: 1.75rem; }
  .wander-diorama-stage { position: relative; min-height: 500px; overflow: hidden; background: #201830; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; }
  .wander-diorama-art { position: absolute; inset: 0; overflow: hidden; }
  .wander-art-fallback { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 8; display: grid; place-content: center; gap: .5rem; background: #211a35; padding: 2rem; color: #fff1bd; text-align: center; }.wander-art-fallback[hidden] { display: none; }.wander-art-fallback span { color: #d9c8e5; font-size: .8rem; }

  /* ── Full-screen photo entrance (replaces the old 6-layer stack) ── */
  .wander-room-photo { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 1; display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center; transform-origin: var(--zoom-x, 50%) var(--zoom-y, 50%); transform: scale(var(--zoom-scale, 1)) translate3d(calc(var(--parallax-x, 0px)), calc(var(--parallax-y, 0px)), 0); transition: transform .6s cubic-bezier(.22, .8, .28, 1), opacity .5s ease; will-change: transform; }
  .wander-room-photo-next { z-index: 2; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  .wander-room-photo-next[data-crossfading="true"] { opacity: 1; }
  .wander-room-vignette { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 3; pointer-events: none; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 55%, rgba(10, 6, 18, .38) 100%); }
  .wander-dust { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 4; pointer-events: none; opacity: .35; background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 226, 163, .55) 0 1px, transparent 1.5px); background-size: 60px 60px, 90px 90px; background-position: 0 0, 30px 40px; animation: wander-dust-drift 26s linear infinite; mix-blend-mode: screen; }
  @keyframes wander-dust-drift { from { background-position: 0 0, 30px 40px; } to { background-position: 60px 90px, -30px 130px; } }
  [data-wander-3d][data-scene="night"] .wander-dust { opacity: .5; background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(150, 170, 220, .6) 0 1px, transparent 1.5px); }
  [data-wander-3d][data-scene="day"] .wander-dust { opacity: .18; }

  /* ── Invisible hotspots: no visible chrome until hover/focus ── */
  .wander-diorama-hotspots { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 5; }
  .room-hotspot { position: absolute; border: 0; border-radius: .6rem; background: transparent; cursor: pointer; outline-offset: 3px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
  .room-hotspot-label { position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: calc(100% + .5rem); transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(4px); white-space: nowrap; border-radius: .35rem; background: rgba(23, 18, 37, .88); padding: .3rem .55rem; color: #fff1bd; font-size: .68rem; opacity: 0; transition: opacity .18s, transform .18s; pointer-events: none; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, .25); }
  .room-hotspot::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: .6rem; box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(255, 209, 102, 0); transition: box-shadow .2s, background .2s; }
  .room-hotspot:hover::after, .room-hotspot:focus-visible::after, .room-hotspot[data-active="true"]::after { box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(255, 209, 102, .85), 0 0 18px 2px rgba(255, 209, 102, .35); background: rgba(255, 209, 102, .07); }
  .room-hotspot:hover .room-hotspot-label, .room-hotspot:focus-visible .room-hotspot-label { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
  .room-hotspot:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #ffd166; }
  /* Percentage-based regions matched to the four bedroom-*.webp base images (shared geometry) */
  .hotspot-anime { left: 3%; top: 18%; width: 20%; height: 62%; }
  .hotspot-notes { left: 63%; top: 28%; width: 30%; height: 55%; }
  .hotspot-photo { left: 75%; top: 8%; width: 16%; height: 24%; }
  .hotspot-memo { left: 2%; top: 68%; width: 12%; height: 20%; }
  .wander-easter-egg { position: absolute; left: 46%; top: 12%; width: 1.5rem; height: 1.5rem; border: 0; border-radius: 50%; background: transparent; color: #ffe0a0; font-size: .9rem; opacity: .55; transition: transform .2s, opacity .2s, text-shadow .2s; z-index: 6; }.wander-easter-egg:hover, .wander-easter-egg:focus-visible { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.2); text-shadow: 0 0 8px #ffb45f; outline: none; }.wander-easter-egg[data-found="true"] { color: #ffb45f; opacity: 1; }

  .wander-3d-hint { position: absolute; top: 1rem; left: 1rem; z-index: 7; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, .35); border-radius: .5rem; background: rgba(23, 19, 31, .72); padding: .4rem .7rem; color: #f4d8ff; font-size: .68rem; backdrop-filter: blur(6px); }
  .wander-3d-memory { position: absolute; top: 1rem; right: 1rem; z-index: 7; display: grid; gap: .15rem; max-width: 13rem; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, .35); border-radius: .5rem; background: rgba(23, 19, 31, .72); padding: .45rem .7rem; color: #f0dff7; font-size: .68rem; text-align: right; backdrop-filter: blur(6px); }
  .wander-3d-memory span:empty { display: none; }.wander-3d-memory span:last-child { color: #ffd166; }
  .wander-3d-controls { position: absolute; left: 1rem; bottom: 1rem; z-index: 7; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .45rem; }
  .wander-3d-controls button, .wander-3d-skip, .wander-3d-enter { border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, .35); border-radius: .5rem; background: rgba(23, 19, 31, .72); padding: .45rem .75rem; color: #f4d8ff; font-size: .72rem; backdrop-filter: blur(6px); transition: transform .18s, background .18s, border-color .18s; }
  .wander-3d-controls button:hover, .wander-3d-controls button[data-active="true"] { border-color: #ffd166; background: #704c9e; color: white; transform: translate(-1px, -1px); }
  .wander-3d-enter { position: absolute; right: 7rem; bottom: 1rem; z-index: 7; background: #ffd166; color: #38254f; font-weight: 700; }.wander-3d-enter:hover { transform: translate(-1px, -1px); background: #ffe29a; }
  .wander-3d-skip { position: absolute; right: 1rem; bottom: 1rem; z-index: 7; color: #d0bed8; }
  .wander-game-panel { border-top: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, .3); background: #211a35; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem 1.5rem; color: #fff7ed; }
  .wander-game-heading { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; }.wander-game-kicker { color: #ffd166; font-size: .65rem; letter-spacing: .16em; }.wander-game-heading h3 { margin-top: .35rem; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.35rem; }.wander-game-close { border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, .4); border-radius: .5rem; padding: .15rem .55rem; color: #f4d8ff; font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1; }.wander-game-copy { margin-top: .5rem; color: #d9c8e5; font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.5rem; }
  .wander-book-slots, .wander-book-tray { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: .6rem; }.wander-book-slots { margin-top: 1rem; }.wander-book-tray { margin-top: .75rem; min-height: 3.5rem; }.wander-book-slot, .wander-book { min-height: 3.5rem; border: 1px solid #76568a; border-radius: .5rem; padding: .55rem .45rem; font-size: .75rem; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #0f0d1a; transition: transform .15s, border-color .15s, background .15s; }.wander-book-slot { background: #302146; color: #cdb8dc; }.wander-book-slot[data-selected="true"], .wander-book[data-selected="true"] { border-color: #ffd166; transform: translate(-1px, -1px); }.wander-book { background: #704c9e; color: #fff7ed; cursor: pointer; }.wander-book:hover, .wander-book-slot:hover { border-color: #ffd166; transform: translate(-1px, -1px); }.wander-game-status { min-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: .8rem; color: #e7c6ff; font-size: .75rem; }.wander-game-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: .75rem; margin-top: .5rem; font-size: .72rem; }.wander-game-actions button, .wander-game-actions a, .wander-game-complete a { border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, .4); border-radius: .5rem; padding: .4rem .65rem; color: #f4d8ff; }.wander-game-actions button:hover, .wander-game-actions a:hover, .wander-game-complete a:hover { border-color: #ffd166; color: #fff7ed; }.wander-game-complete { display: grid; gap: .3rem; margin-top: 1rem; border: 1px solid #d59b37; border-radius: .6rem; background: #4d3a30; padding: .8rem; color: #fff1bd; font-size: .78rem; }.wander-game-complete span { color: #f7dfac; }.wander-game-complete a { width: fit-content; margin-top: .3rem; border-color: #d59b37; color: #fff1bd; }

  .wander-room-finale { position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 4.1rem; z-index: 7; width: min(30rem, calc(100% - 2rem)); transform: translateX(-50%); border: 1px solid #d59b37; border-radius: .6rem; background: rgba(45, 30, 62, .92); padding: .55rem .8rem; color: #fff1bd; font-size: .7rem; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 1rem 2.5rem rgba(0, 0, 0, .35); }.wander-room-finale[hidden] { display: none; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .wander-dust { animation: none; } .wander-room-photo, .room-hotspot-label, .room-hotspot::after { transition: none; } }
  @media (max-width: 639px) { .wander-diorama-copy { padding: 1rem 1rem 0; }.wander-diorama-copy h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; }.wander-diorama-stage { min-height: 320px; }.wander-3d-controls { right: 1rem; bottom: 3.8rem; }.wander-3d-enter { left: 1rem; right: auto; }.room-hotspot-label { font-size: .62rem; }.wander-book-slots, .wander-book-tray { gap: .4rem; }.wander-book-slot, .wander-book { min-height: 3.25rem; font-size: .68rem; } }
</style>

<script src="../scripts/wander-diorama.ts"></script>
<script src="../scripts/wander-book-game.ts"></script>
